Depends: ${misc:Depends}, koinos-hwcaps, libc6-riscv64-cross (>= 2.38)
Description: Agile611 Koinos RISC-V IFUNC Resolvers for RVV 1.0 Vectorized Routines
 This package provides IFUNC (Indirect Function) resolvers for RVV 1.0
 vectorized routines that are automatically selected at runtime based
 on hardware capabilities detected via the hwprobe syscall.
 .
 The resolvers query RISCV_HWPROBE_KEY_IMA_EXT_0 via the hwprobe syscall
 to detect RVA23U64 profile support and select appropriate vectorized
 implementations of performance-critical functions.
 .
 This package is part of the Agile611 Koinos RISC-V distribution's hwcaps infrastructure.
